          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_6 Remark
            %p
              Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SemiaddtiveStructureUnderlyingAdditiveInducesOriginalEnrichment"}
              says that being an
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/additive+category"} additive category
              is an extra
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/property"} property
              on a category, not extra
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structure"} structure
